# Evening MCQ — 15 questions, one paper

Ghost Recall stays **8 Q / 60 min** in the morning. Do not mix the two formats.

## Hard limits

- **15 Prelims MCQs in one message.** Nik answers in one reply (`1-b, 2-a, …`; `pass` allowed).
- Scoring: **+2 / −0.66**. Max **30**. Unattempted = 0.
- Target **~35–40 min** (was 10 Q / ~25 min). If it overruns badly, cut to 12 next night — do not bleed into Ghost Recall.
- Do **not** run 15 sequential Q&A rounds.

## Mix (typical night)

| Count | Source |
|:---:|:---|
| 6–8 | Today’s class(es) |
| 2–3 | Due Mistake Bank traps |
| 4–6 | Older notes / PYQ-style, not tomorrow’s Ghost Recall cluster dump |

Mark: key + one trap sentence on misses. Log `_revision-log.md` + `_mistake-bank.md`. Fail → atom at +1. Do **not** spawn extra Day-1 Ghost Recall rows.
